<title>USA: Mitchell Energy sets qtly dividends.</title>
<headline>Mitchell Energy sets qtly dividends.</headline>
<dateline>THE WOODLANDS, Texas 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitchell Energy &amp; Developemnt Corp said on Tuesday it set regular quarterly dividends for its class A and class B common stock.</p>
<p>A dividend of $0.12 per share for the company's class A common stock and $0.1325 for its class B common stock are payable on January 14 1997 to stockholders of record at close of business on December 31 1996.</p>
<p>The dividends are unchanged from the previous quarter.</p>
